language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Kidney exchange: people on a waiting list donate to each other along compatibility; anyone who gives a kidney must receive one, and each person receives at most one, maximising the number of kidneys transplanted.
given num_people : int(1..)
given compatible_dim2 : int(1..)
$ compatible[i,k] is the k-th person that person i can donate to (padded with 0)
given compatible : matrix indexed by [int(1..num_people), int(1..compatible_dim2)] of int(0..num_people)

$ transplants[i,j] is 1 when person i donates a kidney to person j
find transplants : matrix indexed by [int(1..num_people), int(1..num_people)] of bool

branching on [transplants]
heuristic conflict
maximising (sum i : int(1..num_people) . sum j : int(1..num_people) . toInt(transplants[i,j]))
such that
$ a transplant from i to j is allowed only if j is in the compatibility list of i
forAll i : int(1..num_people) . forAll j : int(1..num_people) . (transplants[i,j] -> (exists k : int(1..compatible_dim2) . (compatible[i,k] = j))),
$ nobody donates a kidney to themselves
forAll i : int(1..num_people) . (transplants[i,i] = false),
$ no person gives more than one kidney
forAll i : int(1..num_people) . ((sum j : int(1..num_people) . toInt(transplants[i,j])) <= 1),
$ no person receives more than one kidney
forAll j : int(1..num_people) . ((sum i : int(1..num_people) . toInt(transplants[i,j])) <= 1),
$ anyone who gives a kidney must receive one, and anyone who receives one must give one
forAll i : int(1..num_people) . ((sum j : int(1..num_people) . toInt(transplants[i,j])) = (sum j : int(1..num_people) . toInt(transplants[j,i])))
